---

This package is an independent implementation for Laravel 5.0. It follows the
database schema and the watcher architecture of laravel/telescope
(https://github.com/laravel/telescope, MIT, Copyright (c) Taylor Otwell), but
shares no code with it: every hook had to be rewritten against the Laravel 5.0
APIs. Telescope is a trademark of its respective owner; this project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Laravel.
